  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Solomon Islands Google Submarine Cable Branch System - Solomon Islands - Telecommunications</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Project will see the construction of: 

&#x2022;	a circa 1,015 kilometre international submarine telecommunications cable from the Google Pacific Connect trunk system into Honiara, Solomon Islands; and 
&#x2022;	associated Land-Based Infrastructure including a beach landing, land cable duct route, cable landing station, off-grid electricity generation and storage, and additional office space.  

Once completed, the Project will enhance the resilience of Solomon Islands&#x2019; international submarine telecommunications network.</narrative>
  </description>
